WEBVTT

00:01:28.958 --> 00:01:31.559
and that is for the existing
Hirshhorn Museum

00:01:31.583 --> 00:01:33.184
that's sited

00:01:33.208 --> 00:01:35.476
on the most revered
public space in America,

00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:38.409
the National Mall.

00:01:38.433 --> 00:01:39.976
The Mall is a symbol

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:42.809
of American democracy.

00:01:42.833 --> 00:01:45.809
And what's fantastic is that this symbol

00:01:45.833 --> 00:01:48.018
is not a thing, it's not an image,

00:01:48.042 --> 00:01:49.726
it's not an artifact,

00:01:49.750 --> 00:01:51.434
actually it's a space,

00:01:51.458 --> 00:01:54.284
and it's kind of just defined
by a line of buildings

00:01:54.308 --> 00:01:56.315
on either side.

00:01:56.339 --> 00:02:00.059
It's a space where citizens
can voice their discontent